        '由于算法实现缺失，您的密码无法使用。',
      'Before running storage upgrades, you should take down the web interface and stop any running daemons (you can disable this warning with %s).' =>
        '在运行存储升级之前，您应关闭 Web 界面并停止任何正在运行的守护进程（您可以使用 %s 禁用此警告）。',
      'Before you can set up or use LDAP, you need to install the PHP LDAP extension. It is not currently installed, so PHP can not talk to LDAP. Usually you can install it with `%s`, `%s`, or a similar package manager command.' =>
        '在设置或使用 LDAP 之前，您需要安装 PHP LDAP 扩展。它当前未安装，因此 PHP 无法与 LDAP 通信。通常您可以使用 `%s`、`%s` 或类似的包管理器命令进行安装。',
      'Blacklist subnets to prevent user-initiated outbound requests.' => '将子网加入黑名单以防止用户发起的出站请求。',
      'Blueprint "%s" (of type "%s") is not properly implemented: %s must return an object of type %s or throw, but returned something else.' =>
        '蓝图 "%s"（类型为 "%s"）未正确实现：%s 必须返回 %s 类型的对象或抛出异常，但返回了其他内容。',
      'Blueprint "%s" (of type "%s") is not properly implemented: it built a resource of type "%s" to satisfy a lease requesting a resource of type "%s".' =>
        '蓝图 "%s"（类型为 "%s"）未正确实现：它构建了类型为 "%s" 的资源来满足请求类型为 "%s" 资源的租赁。',
      'Blueprint "%s" (of type "%s") is not properly implemented: it returned from "%s" with a lease acquired on the wrong resource.' =>
        '蓝图 "%s"（类型为 "%s"）未正确实现：它从 "%s" 返回时获取了错误资源的租赁。',
      'Blueprint "%s" (of type "%s") is not properly implemented: it returned from "%s" without acquiring a lease.' =>
        '蓝图 "%s"（类型为 "%s"）未正确实现：它从 "%s" 返回时未获取租赁。',
      'Blueprint "%s" (of type "%s") is not properly implemented: it returned from "%s" without activating a lease.' =>
        '蓝图 "%s"（类型为 "%s"）未正确实现：它从 "%s" 返回时未激活租赁。',
      'Blueprint "%s" could not be loaded. Try a blueprint ID or PHID.' => '无法加载蓝图 "%s"。请尝试使用蓝图 ID 或 PHID。',
      'Blueprint failed to allocate a resource after claiming it would be able to: [%s] %s' =>
        '蓝图在声称能够分配资源后未能分配：[%s] %s',
      'Blueprints allow to lease fresh working copies of repositories, on your Drydock devices, when needed by CI/CD workflows, and more. Blueprints lease services defined in your Almanac.' =>
        '蓝图允许在 CI/CD 工作流需要时，在您的 Drydock 设备上租赁仓库的全新工作副本，等等。蓝图租赁在您的 Almanac 中定义的服务。',
      'Both references identify the same commit. You can not compare a commit against itself.' =>
        '两个引用指向同一个提交。无法将提交与自身进行比较。',
