      'Build parent caches in repositories that are missing the data, or rebuild them in a specific __repository__.' =>
        '在缺少数据的仓库中构建父缓存，或在特定的 __repository__ 中重建它们。',
      'Build step "%s" has step group key "%s", but no step group with that key exists.' =>
        '构建步骤 "%s" 具有步骤组键 "%s"，但不存在具有该键的步骤组。',
