      'Expected fulltext engine extension ("%s") to return a list of functions from "newFerretSearchFunctions()", got "%s".' =>
        '预期全文搜索引擎扩展（"%s"）从 "newFerretSearchFunctions()" 返回函数列表，但实际得到 "%s"。',
