      'Expected to find a Git repository at "%s", but there is a file there instead. Move or remove this file. A daemon will construct the working copy for you.' =>
        '预期在 "%s" 处找到 Git 仓库，但该位置却是一个文件。请移动或删除此文件。守护进程将为您构建工作副本。',
      'Expected to find a Git repository at "%s", but there is a non-repository directory (with other stuff in it) there. Move or remove this directory. A daemon will construct the working copy for you.' =>
