        '无法将公钥转换为 PKCS8 格式。如果您在 OSX 上开发，可以使用 `%s` 来解决此问题。%s',
      'Failed to create a new ref cursor (for "%s", of type "%s", in repository "%s") because it collided with an existing cursor, but then failed to load that cursor.' =>
