        '在键冲突后无法加载键为 "%s" 的图表。这不应该发生。',
      'Failed to load or generate dimension ID ("%s") for dimension key "%s".' => '无法加载或生成维度键 "%s" 的维度 ID ("%s")。',

      'Failed to load the commit because the commit has not been parsed yet.' => '无法加载提交，因为该提交尚未被解析。',

      'Failed to reconnect to master database and release held write lock ("%s") on device "%s" for repository "%s" after trying for %s seconds. This repository will be frozen.' =>
        '在尝试 %s 秒后，无法重新连接到主数据库并释放仓库 "%s" 上设备 "%s" 持有的写锁 ("%s")。此仓库将被冻结。',
      'Failed to reload object identified by monogram "%s" when querying by PHID.' => '通过 PHID 查询时，无法重新加载由字母组合 "%s" 标识的对象。',

