      'The content of this mail is sensitive and it can not be viewed from the web UI.' =>
        '此邮件的内容是敏感的，无法从 Web UI 查看。',
      'The content of this revision is hidden until the author has signed all of the required legal agreements.' =>
        '此修订的内容已被隐藏，直到作者签署了所有必需的法律协议。',
