      'The diff was generated from a raw input source, so the change could not be pushed to staging. Changes must be pushed to staging before they can be landed from the web.' =>
        '该 diff 是从原始输入源生成的，因此无法将更改推送到暂存区。更改必须先推送到暂存区，然后才能从网页上提交。',
      'The directory containing the "svnlook" binary is not listed in "environment.append-paths", so commit hooks (which execute with an empty "PATH") will not be able to find "svnlook". Add `%s` to %s.' =>
        '包含 "svnlook" 二进制文件的目录未在 "environment.append-paths" 中列出，因此提交钩子（在空 "PATH" 下执行）将无法找到 "svnlook"。请将 `%s` 添加到 %s。',
      'The email address associated with this account ("%s") is already in use by an application and can not be used to register a new account. Choose a different, valid address.' =>
