        '无法弹出分析器堆栈：期望类型为 "%s" 且键为 "%s" 的帧，但找到类型为 "%s" 且键为 "%s" 的帧。',
      'Unable to promote "%s" for repository "%s" because this cluster already has one or more unambiguous leaders: %s.' =>
        '无法将 "%s" 提升为仓库 "%s" 的领导者，因为此集群已有一个或多个明确的领导者：%s。',
      'Unable to proxy this SSH request within the cluster: this device is not registered and has a missing device key (expected to find key at "%s").' =>
        '无法在集群内代理此 SSH 请求：此设备未注册且缺少设备密钥（预期在 "%s" 找到密钥）。',
      'Unable to read device private key while attempting to make authenticated method call within the cluster. Use `%s` to register keys for this device. Exception: %s' =>
        '在尝试于集群内进行认证方法调用时无法读取设备私钥。使用 `%s` 为设备注册密钥。异常：%s',
      'Unable to read device public key while attempting to make authenticated method call within the cluster. Use `%s` to register keys for this device. Exception: %s' =>
        '在尝试于集群内进行认证方法调用时无法读取设备公钥。使用 `%s` 为设备注册密钥。异常：%s',
      'Unable to retrieve Ferret engine metadata, this class ("%s") does not support the Ferret engine.' =>
        '无法检索 Ferret 引擎元数据，此类（"%s"）不支持 Ferret 引擎。',
